---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const book = 'https://www.maklugarant.eu/product/bewegend-leren-musiceren-een-kinemuzikale-benadering-van-het-instrumentaal-muziekonderwijs/';
---
<Base title="Home" path="/">
  <div class="page quotes">
    <p>
      <em>"Therefore, when studying a musical instrument,</em>
      <em>the task is to disengage ourselves from the all-too-normal assumption of a “thing body”</em>
      <em>and to constitute instead the “swing body”,</em>
      <em>the one that dances, flows moves freely, fluidly, flexibly,</em>
      <em>like swing music"</em>
      (Elisabeth Behnke)
    </p>
    <p>
      <em>"Well, you know, rhythm must be felt as a dance, not calculated....</em>
      <em>I think music is rooted in instinct for rhythmic bodily movement, even more than the instinct to search for beautiful sounds."</em>
      (Charles Dutoit)
    </p>
    <img class="cover" src="/images/kimupe-cover.png" alt="Sketches of a clarinettist playing while moving" width="343" height="113" />
    <p class="book"><a href={book} target="_blank" rel="noopener">book in dutch</a></p>
    <a href={book} target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Book in Dutch: Bewegend leren musiceren">
      <img class="book-cover" src="/images/book-cover.png" alt="Cover of the book Bewegend leren musiceren" width="90" height="122" />
    </a>
  </div>
</Base>
